@startuml
title <size:24>Dynamic View: nyx</size>\n<size:24>What happens when the window solves the active physics.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam nodesep 30
hide stereotype

<style>
  root {
    BackgroundColor: #ffffff;
    FontColor: #444444;
  }
  // Element,Container,Executable
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsRXhlY3V0YWJsZQ== {
    BackgroundColor: #438dd5;
    LineColor: #2e6295;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    RoundCorner: 20;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Container,Library
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ== {
    BackgroundColor: #438dd5;
    LineColor: #2e6295;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Container,Library,Kernel
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeSxLZXJuZWw= {
    BackgroundColor: #2e7d32;
    LineColor: #205723;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Container,Store
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsU3RvcmU= {
    BackgroundColor: #438dd5;
    LineColor: #2e6295;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Relationship
  .Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw {
    LineThickness: 2;
    LineStyle: 10-10;
    LineColor: #444444;
    FontColor: #444444;
    FontSize: 24;
  }
  // nyx
  .Boundary-bnl4 {
    BackgroundColor: #ffffff;
    LineColor: #0b4884;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
  }
</style>

rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  database "==Results file\n<size:16>[Container: File .h5 and .xdmf]</size>\n\nProject, mesh and every solution of every solved physics, compressed, exact; with an XDMF description next to it." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsU3RvcmU=>> as nyx.Resultsfile
  component "==nyx-engine\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe Engine: one project, the mesh built for it, the latest result of each physics, the jobs that produce them, and the binding to a workflow. Every action is a named command with a JSON Schema." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxengine
  component "==nyx-ems\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nEM waves: waveguide modes (real and complex), axisymmetric, cavity in 3D." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeSxLZXJuZWw=>> as nyx.nyxems
  rectangle "==app\n<size:16>[Container: Rust, eframe/egui]</size>\n\nThe egui window (binary nyx): geometry editor, mesh view, Study, Physics and Materials tabs drawn from the physics descriptors, results, analysis, workflow dashboard. A front-end of the engine: it holds an Engine and calls commands." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsRXhlY3V0YWJsZQ==>> as nyx.app
  component "==nyx-store\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nWorkspace, workflow, experiment and run storage: manifests, append-only run log, versions, search, .nyx archives. Knows nothing of a project." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxstore
  component "==femcore\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe FEM core: meshes, meshing and adaptation, linear algebra behind one driver, finite-element basics, the material specification and library, expressions." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.femcore
}

nyx.app --> nyx.nyxengine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "1: start_solve(targets)\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.femcore <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "2: mesh the model when none is current\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.nyxems <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "3: Physics::solve(mesh, spec, ctx)\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxems --> nyx.femcore <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "4: assemble, shift-invert eigensolve\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.nyxstore <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "5: record the run, freeze the spec\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.Resultsfile <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "6: write results.h5 and results.xdmf\n<size:16>[HDF5 (serial or MPI-IO), XDMF]</size>"
nyx.app --> nyx.nyxengine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "7: poll: take the mesh and the results\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"

@enduml